===Etymology===
{{PIE word|ru|wek⁽ʷ⁾speros}}
From {{inh|ru|orv|вечеръ}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*večerъ}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-bsl-pro|*wékeras}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-pro|*wekʷsperos}}. Cognates include {{cog|grc|ἕσπερος}} (whence {{m|ru|Эспе́р}}, {{m|ru|гесперо́рнис}}, {{m|ru|геспери́да}}, {{m|ru|геспери́дий}}), {{cog|la|vesper}}, {{cog|xcl|գիշեր|}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|ве́чер}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-вечер.ogg}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Tatiana Kerbush-вечер.wav|a=Saint Petersburg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|c|ве́чер|(1)|adj=вече́рний|dim=вечеро́к}}

# [[evening]] (after 8 PM)
